{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/06/2026itQhW8DUxM1782694246.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">佛山順德有廠房起火，至少8死1傷。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">新華社報道事發在昨日下午，位於順德區的一間紡織公司廠區發生火災事故，造成死傷，當局目前仍在進行搜救。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T05:18:27.335228+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":68,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}